WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:01.840
It definitely will

00:03.120 --> 00:04.360
Your Highness's word is law

00:04.440 --> 00:06.240
Don't fool me

00:06.800 --> 00:08.600
This northern expedition

00:08.800 --> 00:12.360
Is only the first step to reclaiming the land

00:12.440 --> 00:13.800
The Wunu are fierce, that's true

